ValidationError.description:
Request body failed schema validation.
This response is returned when the request body does not conform to the endpoint's expected schema. The `details` array contains one object per validation failure, making it suitable for rendering error messages in UI forms.
## Example response
```json {
  "error": "Validation failed",
  "details": [
    {
      "path": ["body", "model"],
      "message": "Expected string, received number",
      "code": "invalid_type",
      "expected": "string",
      "received": "number"
    }
  ]
} ```
